        "notes": "Violence and Gore: The game features graphic depictions of violence, including dismemberment, blood, and grotesque imagery. Players may encounter scenes involving mutilation and disturbing physical violence.\r\nPsychological Distress: The game explores themes of mental illness, trauma, and guilt, featuring unsettling hallucinations, disturbing voices, and other elements that contribute to the protagonist\u2019s psychological unraveling. Players will experience intense psychological horror that may be emotionally distressing.\r\nDeath and Suicide: The narrative touches on dark themes of death and suicidal ideation, focusing on the emotional and psychological consequences of these events.\r\nDisturbing Imagery: The game features moments of unsettling visuals, including grotesque monsters, decaying environments, and other horrific scenes that may cause emotional discomfort.\r\nSubstance Abuse: The game contains references to psychotropic drug use and medication as part of the protagonist's struggle with mental health issues."
